Hi Avery,

You're invited to a live session with Carta's equity and legal teams:

Series A term sheets: the five terms founders regret signing
Thursday, September 10 · 10:00am PT · 45 minutes

We'll walk through anonymized data from 1,400 priced rounds closed on Carta in the last twelve months and cover:
- Liquidation preference stacks and when 1x non-participating stops being the norm
- Option pool sizing: pre- vs. post-money and what it costs you
- Pro rata rights and information rights that outlast the round
- Board composition patterns by round size

Speakers: Ingrid Solberg (Head of Equity Advisory, Carta) and Jamal Whitaker (Partner, Ashgrove Law).

